Third party notices
===================

The standalone release of this patch redistributes one binary that is not built from
this repository: the `dinput8.dll` beside the patch, which in this archive is under
"Copy into game folder" and which the source tree keeps at vendor/dinput8.dll.

It is Ultimate ASI Loader, taken unmodified from its own release. The patch itself is
under the Mozilla Public License 2.0 and is unaffected by anything below; these terms
apply to that one file.

    Component:  Ultimate ASI Loader
    Version:    v9.7.4
    Source:     https://github.com/ThirteenAG/Ultimate-ASI-Loader
    Obtained:   https://github.com/ThirteenAG/Ultimate-ASI-Loader/releases/download/v9.7.4/Ultimate-ASI-Loader-NoPDB.zip
    SHA-256:    ec2f4824eca58dd40f425756a4a7cec77b8e381f21d11d7c846ec4b339b617ab

