-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Also carried by the loader
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The loader's build also draws on miniz and on the Direct3D 9 headers in minidx9. Their
terms are in the loader's own repository, under external/, at the revision its release
was built from.


-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Updating the vendored loader
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Replace vendor/dinput8.dll from a release of the project above, then update the
version, URL and checksum at the top of this file. The checksum is what makes it
possible to say later exactly which build was shipped.
